### Backend technologies

#### Database & ORM

- **PostgreSQL 16** (Alpine, Docker)  
- **Prisma 6** — type-safe client; catalog includes departments/categories and junction tables as in `schema.prisma`.  
- **Schema apply (not `prisma/migrations/` only)**: `psql "$DATABASE_URL_DIRECT"` runs `app/prisma/schema_changes.sql` then `schema_population.sql` on prod (`Dockerfile.prd` entrypoint) and dev (`app/docker-entrypoint.sh`). Idempotent; use a **direct** Postgres URL (not PgBouncer transaction pool for DDL).  
- **Studio**: `npx prisma studio` (e.g. port 5555)  
- **Local one-shot**: `npm run db:apply-schema` when `DATABASE_URL_DIRECT` is set  

#### API layer

- **Next.js Route Handlers** (App Router)  
- Public: `/api/products`, `/api/checkout`, `/api/cart/validate`, `/api/feeds/*`  
- Admin: `/api/products`, `/api/orders`, `/api/ai/*`, `/api/whatsapp/*`, etc.  
- Webhooks: Stripe, PayPal  

